			"body": "# Ultimate Macro 1.4.0.37\n\n## Fixes since the public 1.4 build\n\n- Correct Easy/Casual selection and recognize the current Survival menu, including Fallen and Frost cards below the first row and narrow/docked layouts.\n- Improve auto-equip search focus and input timing; clear the first and fifth slots using the live inventory row; recognize the exact DJ Booth caption for DJ strategies. Every equipment action still requires an owned control and a confirmed result.\n- Fix the strategy-rotation crash that tried to read a nonexistent third slot.\n- Make Advanced settings and Match options open into view. Stop native fields from jumping the page or remaining over offscreen content.\n- Save valid recording shortcuts when leaving their fields. Conflicting/reserved shortcuts keep the previous working bindings and show an explanation.\n- Import supported preferences from older 1.3.6 `.ump` profiles without importing private fields or replacing strategies.\n- Refresh docked window rendering and wait for a stable replacement game window during relaunch.\n- Fix the graphics cleanup error when closing the macro.\n- Keep signed ZIP downloads separate from installation: background checks/downloads are optional, installation still needs approval, and the old folder stays in place.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Close Roblox chat manually if it covers the game. The retired fixed-position chat click is disabled because the Roblox topbar changed.\n- Windows may show its capture indicator during target-window OCR. Do not disable Windows security settings to hide it.\n- Older strategies may need updates after TDS map, tower or balance changes. This update is not a guarantee that every community strategy wins or that no bugs remain.\n\n## Updating\n\nUse **Settings → Check for updates**, then **Review update → Install**. Extraction creates a separate version folder. Open that folder's `Main.ahk` when ready; nothing installs or restarts the macro without your approval.\n\nZIP SHA-256: `49c1a1269b50076fcdbf6f40d1a4ddd5bb596d70f80104157cc833244b6a3d1e`\n",
