			"body": "> **The biggest and most polished Ultimate Macro update yet is here.**\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n1. Adaptive resolution support across 16:9 resolutions from 720p all the way to 4K, with 8K scaling included.\r\n2. Completely upgraded Discord personal-bot interface with Components V2 cards, buttons, menus, screenshots, status controls, and strategy selection.\r\n3. Added optional Discord gateway support for faster bot commands and status updates.\r\n4. Added Strategy Lab, spatial-action systems, new strategy metadata, and expanded QA resources.\r\n5. Added the new Ultimate Macro icon and refreshed interface assets.\r\n\r\n**Improvements:**\r\n1. Faster actions, faster inputs, cached delays, and improved overall macro performance.\r\n2. Improved image detection with resolution-aware search scaling.\r\n3. Improved tower placement, upgrades, recovery, watchdog behavior, and action confirmation.\r\n4. Improved Roblox window handling, camera alignment, coordinate scaling, and multi-resolution support.\r\n5. Improved Discord setup, bot health checks, token validation, command feedback, and strategy controls.\r\n6. Rebuilt the release on the stable 1.3.5 foundation while bringing over the best RC features.\r\n7. Improved UI layout, bot setup, token fields, connection status, and command feedback.\r\n\r\n**Bug Fixes:**\r\n1. Fixed actions breaking when using resolutions other than 1920×1080.\r\n2. Fixed image searches using incorrect bounds on different resolutions.\r\n3. Fixed legacy submacros failing to adapt to different screen sizes.\r\n4. Fixed Discord replies failing when no active interaction was available.\r\n5. Fixed missing runtime files and Strategy Lab components from the unstable RC build.\r\n6. Fixed multiple recovery and confirmation issues that could cause actions to stop early or behave inconsistently.\r\n\r\n**Ultimate Macro 1.3.5 is faster, cleaner, more reliable, and ready for every supported setup.**",
