			"body": "# v1.3.4\n\nNew Features:\n\n1. Profile Manager - import and export settings, hotkeys, and strategies, with previews and backups.\n2. Official Discord Remote Control - use EngineerBot to start, stop, check status, and take screenshots.\n3. Auto Configure Settings - optionally prepare Roblox settings before launch and restore them after closing.\n4. Arcade Recording - added Arcade mode, an editable map field, and Arcade/Trial selection.\n5. Added log controls, custom bot prefixes, and commands for version, stats, logs, and strategy selection.\n\nImprovements:\n\n1. Improved image detection, matchmaking, camera alignment, Auto Equip, and Party invites.\n2. Improved watchdog recovery and reduced CPU usage.\n3. Safer updates with backups, rollback, and strategy protection.\n4. Improved webhook handling and Discord settings pages.\n\nBug Fixes:\n\n1. Fixed detection issues with moved windows and multiple monitors.\n2. Fixed recording, replay scaling, cloning, and Brawler repositioning.\n3. Fixed upgrade issues, tower tracking, and attempts to upgrade maxed towers.\n4. Fixed hotbar selection, DJ tracks, and Support Caravan blocking Drop the Beat.\n5. Fixed Party Mode, difficulty selection, and Ready button issues.\n6. Fixed stuck inputs after stopping, watchdog cleanup, and personal-bot commands.\n7. Fixed Auto Spin paths and missing-window handling.\n8. Fixed Official Remote connection-code decoding and screenshot encoding crashes.\n\nRemovals:\n\n1. Removed three outdated Frost strategies. Frost mode is still supported.\n2. Disabled automatic strategy refresh in Git checkouts only.\n",
